{"strongs": "H8337", "word": "שֵׁשׁ", "translit": "shesh", "root": "שדש", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "six", "definition": "שֵׁשׁ , שִׁשָּׁה 216 noun masculine and feminine six ; — masculine שֵׁשׁ (c. noun feminine ) Gen 31:41 + 120 t.; feminine שִׁשָּׁה (with noun masculine ) Gen 30:20 + 39 t.; construct שֵׁ֫שֶׁת Exod 23:12 + 30 t. (6 + 10 = 16 are additional); — six (Hexateuch chiefly P ): 1. no other number: \\ \\ a. before plural noun 75 t.: e.g. שֵׁשׁ שָׁנִים Exod 21:2 ( E ) + 11 t., שֵׁשׁ אַמּוֺת 1Sam 17:4 + 8 t.; שֵׁשׁ בָּאַמָּה 1Kgs 6:6 שִׁשָּׁה בָּנִים Gen 30:20 ( E ) + 2 t.; שֵׁשֶׁת יָמִים Exod 23:12 ( E ) + 14 t.; after noun (late) Exod 28:2 ; Josh 15:59 ; Josh 15:62 (all P ), 1Chr 4:27 ; 1Chr 26:17 ; Neh 5:18 rarely noun omitted Lev 24:6 ( P ) + (distributive 2Sam 21:20 = 1Chr 20:6 ). \\ \\ b. = ordinal ׳ שְׁנַת שֵׁשׁ לְחִזְק 2Kgs 18:10 ( Ges «GKC:134o»§ 134o ). 2. 16, c noun feminine : שֵׁשׁ עֶשְׂרֵה , before נָ֑פֶשׁ Gen 46:18 ( P ), שָׁנָה 2Kgs 13:10 + 9 t., בָּנוֺת 2Chr 13:21 after עָרִים Josh 15:41 ; Josh 19:22 ( P ); with noun masculine שִׁשָּׁה עָשָׂר , before אֲדָנִים Exod 26:25 ; Exod 36:30 ( P ), also אֶלֶף , 1000, Num 31:40 + ( P ); after בָּנִים 1Chr 4:27 , etc.; = ordinal 16 th 1Chr 24:14 ; 1Chr 25:23 +, ׳ ע ׳ יוֺם שׁ 2Chr 29:27 . 3. 600 = שֵׁשׁ מֵאוֺת , Gen 7:6 ( P ) + 63 t.; 6000 = שֵׁשֶׁת אֲלָפִים Num 3:34 ( P ) + 8 t.; אֶלֶף ׳ שׁ Judg 20:15 + 2 t. 4. c. tens, ׳ שׁ following Gen 46:26 + 13 t., precedes Num 31:44 ( P ). 5. ׳ שׁ as round number, ׳ חָמֵשׁ אוֺשֿׁ 2Kgs 13:19 , compare Job 5:19 ; Prov 6:16 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8488')\">BDB8488</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8337')\">H8337</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8487')\">BDB8487</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8489')\">BDB8489</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>שִׁשָּׁה</bdbheb><sub>216</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> and <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>six</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>masculine</b> <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ</bdbheb> (c. <b>noun feminine</b>) <ref ref=\"Gen 31:41\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,41)\">Gen 31:41</ref> + 120 t.; <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>שִׁשָּׁה</bdbheb> (with <b>noun masculine</b>) <ref ref=\"Gen 30:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,20)\">Gen 30:20</ref> + 39 t.; construct <bdbheb>שֵׁ֫שֶׁת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,12)\">Exod 23:12</ref> + 30 t. (6 + 10 = 16 are additional); — <highlight>six</highlight> (Hexateuch chiefly <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>): </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> no other number: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> before plural noun 75 t.: <highlight>e.g.</highlight> <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ שָׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 21:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,21,2)\">Exod 21:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) + 11 t., <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ אַמּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,4)\">1Sam 17:4</ref> + 8 t.; <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ בָּאַמָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,6)\">1Kgs 6:6</ref> <bdbheb>שִׁשָּׁה בָּנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 30:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,20)\">Gen 30:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) + 2 t.; <bdbheb>שֵׁשֶׁת יָמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,12)\">Exod 23:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) + 14 t.; after noun (late) <ref ref=\"Exod 28:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,2)\">Exod 28:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 15:59\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"59\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"59\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,59)\">Josh 15:59</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 15:62\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,62)\">Josh 15:62</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,27)\">1Chr 4:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 26:17\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(13,26,17)\">1Chr 26:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 5:18\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(16,5,18)\">Neh 5:18</ref> rarely noun omitted <ref ref=\"Lev 24:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,6)\">Lev 24:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) + (distributive <ref ref=\"2Sam 21:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,21,20)\">2Sam 21:20</ref> = <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,20,6)\">1Chr 20:6</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> = ordinal <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁנַת שֵׁשׁ לְחִזְק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,10)\">2Kgs 18:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:134o»§ 134o</sup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> 16, c <b>noun feminine</b>: <bdbheb>שֵׁשׁ עֶשְׂרֵה</bdbheb>, before <bdbheb>נָ֑פֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 46:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,18)\">Gen 46:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>שָׁנָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,10)\">2Kgs 13:10</ref> + 9 t., <bdbheb>בָּנוֺת</bdbheb> <ref